{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The Echo Dot feels useful because hands-free Alexa control would complement my Fire TV setup; I do not need a larger speaker just for voice control.",
    "The HDMI cable supports my recent focus on home video by helping connect equipment to my 4K television, with useful flexibility in placement."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The older Fire TV devices repeat something I already have covered by my Fire TV Stick 4K and Fire TV television, so their similarity does not create a new need.",
    "The mouse, earbuds, tablet and USB hub do not address a current need arising from my television and camera purchases."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My Fire TV purchases seem to have been taken as interest in more Fire TV players, even though older versions add little to my setup.",
    "Owning electronic equipment seems to have been treated as a reason to suggest general accessories, without a clear connection to what I am trying to do now."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My existing devices matter: useful additions should give me a capability or connection I lack, rather than duplicate equipment I already own.",
    "Compatibility affects whether I would choose an accessory. The memory card could support video recording, but I would need to confirm that it meets my camcorder's requirements."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognized my home video interests, but only some offered a useful next step for the equipment I already have."
}"}
